  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eurocontrols European ATM Voluntary Solidarity Fund 2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Eurocontrols European ATM Voluntary Solidarity Fund 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Eurocontrols fond European ATM Voluntary Solidarity Fund f&#xf6;r uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;llande av flygtrafikledning i Ukraina och Moldavien. Fonden ska anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r att t&#xe4;cka personalkostnader i s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l operativ flygtrafikledningstj&#xe4;nst (flygledare) som f&#xf6;r personal som sk&#xf6;ter underh&#xe5;ll av flygtrafiklednings-utrustning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Eurocontrol&apos;s European ATM Voluntary Solidarity Fund for maintaining air traffic control in Ukraine and Moldova. The fund will be used to cover personnel costs in operational air traffic control services (air traffic controllers) as well as for personnel who manage maintenance of air traffic control equipment.</narrative>
  </description>
